# General
.DS_Store
__MACOSX/
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon[]
._*

# Ignore contents of all submodule directories, but not the submodule reference
**/*/
**/.git/
**/*/*.log
**/*/*.tmp
**/*/target/
**/*/node_modules/

# Ensure the .gitmodules file is not ignored (important for tracking submodule config)
!.gitmodules

# Superproject CI must be committed for GitHub Actions to run it
!.github/
!.github/**

# Course page: source and tests are tracked, build output is not
!site/
!site/**
!test/
!test/**
_site/
node_modules/

# Local-only docs and assistant files
docs/
CONTEXT.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Make sure notes folder is NOT ignored (explicitly include it)
!course_note/
